From 7c64f9ffb82937c20622d398f150d1fc0eece493 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 18:54:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix 3882: render a checkbox for a string with a const

A string field with a `const` and `ui:widget: checkbox` threw
`No widget 'checkbox' for type 'string'`. `StringField` now renders the
registry's `CheckboxWidget` for it: the box is checked when the value
equals the `const`, checking it sets the value to the `const`, and
unchecking it clears the value. Focus and blur report the same string
value.

Also documents the widget in `widgets.md`, adds an example to the
playground's Widgets sample and a changelog entry.
